<h2>Updating</h2>

<p>
	Download the new <b>static/dist</b> folder again, or keep <code>@@master</code> in the CDN links.
	Do not edit <b>winold.css</b> / <b>winold.js</b>: to customize the styles, add your own stylesheet <b>after</b> winold.css.
</p>

<h2>Limitations</h2>

<p>
	<b>winold.js</b> reproduces the behavior of the components, not the Blazor features around them (data binding, forms validation...):
	read and write the values with the DOM and the events. The full options of each box are in the
	<a href="https://github.com/tossnet/Blazor-WinOld/tree/master/static#readme" target="_blank">static sites guide</a>.
</p>
